<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH2a1436-en-f3650d50" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Translation of  into (English)</title><editor role="translator">AI - Gemini</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title/>2026</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH2a1436"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="en">English</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CW">Initially created: <date>2026-01-30T21:05:06.126+09:00</date> by CW</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH2a1436-start"><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.1-h" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">《卷第二》</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">Compiled by Shì Sēngyòu (釋僧祐), Vinaya Master of Jiànchū Sì (建初寺) in Yángdū (楊都), Liáng (梁) Dynasty.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">By Zōng Bǐng (宗炳) of the Jìn (晉) Dynasty.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">《Míng Fó Lùn (明佛論)》 (Treatise on Understanding Buddhism)</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">Indeed, the Way is supremely subtle,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">and its transforming influence truly ought to be revered.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">Yet, many in the world disparage Buddhism,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">all believing, "If I cannot experience it myself, how can I care for what comes after?"</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">Matters thousands of *li* away, beyond a hundred years [in the future],</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.10" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">all are considered unbelievable.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.11" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">How much more so [do they disbelieve] the vastness of Sumeru,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.12" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">the grandeur of the Buddha-lands,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.13" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">that the spirit is immortal,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.14" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">that humans can achieve Buddhahood,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.15" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">that the mind creates all existence,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.16" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">that all phenomena are empty,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1436_CHANT_002-1a.17" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CW" modified="2026-01-30T21:05:28.932+09:00">or that past karmic connections are so protracted that retribution only comes after countless *kalpas*?</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>